@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1 class="h3 mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="text-muted">Last updated: October 8, 2026</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">1. Information we collect</h2>
<p>
    DreamShop does not require an account and does not ask for your name, email address,
    home address, or payment details.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">2. How we use information</h2>
<p>
    Cart contents are used only to display your cart and calculate its total.
    We do not use any information for marketing, profiling, or advertising.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">3. Cookies</h2>
<p>
    DreamShop uses only the cookies required for the site to work securely, such as
    the token that protects forms from forgery. We do not use tracking, analytics,
    or advertising cookies.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">4. Sharing of information</h2>
<p>
    We do not sell, rent, or share any information with third parties.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">5. Data storage and security</h2>
<p>
    Data is kept in a database used by this application. We take reasonable steps to
    protect it, but no system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">6. Your rights</h2>
<p>
    You may ask what information is held, request corrections, or ask for removal of
    items you added. Cart items can also be removed at any time from the Cart page.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">7. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>
    This policy may be updated from time to time. The date at the top shows when it
    was last changed.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">8. Contact</h2>
<p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to <strong>your-email@example.com</strong>.
</p>